  "description": "Lightweight, high-performance ASP.NET Core middleware that adds security headers targeting an A+ rating on securityheaders.com. Includes nonce-based CSP, Strict-Transport-Security, Permissions-Policy, Cross-Origin isolation, Trusted Types, and more — all configurable with a single line of code.",
